## Prompt 1: Prospect Research & Lead Intelligence

Version: v1.0  
Change Made: Created an initial prompt with basic company details and requested general prospect research.  
Observed Effect: Output provided useful information but lacked depth, business context, and clear sales actions.  
Lesson Learned: Adding sales objectives and specific analysis criteria improves AI-generated insights.

Version: v2.0  
Change Made: Added GrowthPilot AI sales role, decision-maker priorities, outreach angles, and instructions to separate facts from assumptions.  
Observed Effect: Output became more relevant, structured, and suitable for sales preparation.  
Lesson Learned: Role-based prompting and constraints improve reliability.


## Prompt 2: Personalised Cold Email Generation

Version: v1.0  
Change Made: Created a prompt requesting a personalised sales email with basic customer information.  
Observed Effect: Email was professional but sounded similar to generic sales messaging.  
Lesson Learned: AI requires communication frameworks and customer context to create stronger outreach.

Version: v2.0  
Change Made: Added AIDA framework, prospect role, business challenge, and tone requirements.  
Observed Effect: Generated more targeted and conversion-focused emails.  
Lesson Learned: Structured frameworks improve consistency and quality of AI outputs.


## Prompt 3: Lead Qualification Scoring

Version: v1.0  
Change Made: Created a prompt asking AI to score sales leads based on basic company information.  
Observed Effect: Lead assessment was general and lacked a consistent evaluation method.  
Lesson Learned: AI decisions improve when based on recognised business frameworks.

Version: v2.0  
Change Made: Added BANT qualification criteria and requested recommended sales actions.  
Observed Effect: Produced clearer lead prioritisation and better sales recommendations.  
Lesson Learned: Adding evaluation criteria makes AI outputs more actionable.


## Prompt 4: Discovery Call Summary

Version: v1.0  
Change Made: Created a prompt to summarise customer discovery notes into CRM information.  
Observed Effect: Summary captured key information but missed some important sales fields.  
Lesson Learned: AI outputs need defined structures for operational use.

Version: v2.0  
Change Made: Added CRM-specific fields including pain points, buying signals, objections, and next actions.  
Observed Effect: Generated more complete CRM-ready notes.  
Lesson Learned: Structured output formats improve workflow automation.


## Prompt 5: Sales Proposal Drafting

Version: v1.0  
Change Made: Created a basic proposal generation prompt using customer needs and GrowthPilot services.  
Observed Effect: Proposal was understandable but focused more on services than business outcomes.  
Lesson Learned: Sales proposals require customer value and ROI-focused instructions.

Version: v2.0  
Change Made: Added business goals, ROI language, implementation timeline, and executive proposal structure.  
Observed Effect: Created more strategic proposals suitable for client discussions.  
Lesson Learned: AI performs better when business objectives are clearly defined.


## Prompt 6: Follow-up Email Automation

Version: v1.0  
Change Made: Created a prompt to generate simple post-meeting follow-up emails.  
Observed Effect: Email was polite but lacked personalisation and customer-specific messaging.  
Lesson Learned: Follow-up communication requires more customer context.

Version: v2.0  
Change Made: Added customer hesitation, previous discussion points, and consultative tone requirements.  
Observed Effect: Produced more relationship-focused follow-ups.  
Lesson Learned: Context improves customer engagement and relevance.


## Prompt 7: Competitor Analysis

Version: v1.0  
Change Made: Created a prompt requesting a general competitor comparison.  
Observed Effect: Analysis provided information but lacked direct sales application.  
Lesson Learned: Business prompts should connect research outputs to decisions.

Version: v2.0  
Change Made: Added competitor weaknesses, sales objections, and GrowthPilot differentiation opportunities.  
Observed Effect: Generated insights that could support sales conversations.  
Lesson Learned: Prompts should define how information will be used.


## Prompt 8: Sales Meeting Agenda Creation

Version: v1.0  
Change Made: Created a prompt to generate a basic discovery meeting agenda.  
Observed Effect: Agenda covered topics but lacked strategic questioning.  
Lesson Learned: AI-generated workflows improve when expected outcomes are specified.

Version: v2.0  
Change Made: Added discovery objectives, strategic questions, buying criteria, and next steps.  
Observed Effect: Created a more structured sales meeting plan.  
