## Prompt 9: CRM Data Cleaning

Version: v1.0  
Change Made: Created a prompt to identify issues in sales records.  
Observed Effect: Output identified problems but did not prioritise business impact.  
Lesson Learned: AI recommendations become more useful when linked to business priorities.

Version: v2.0  
Change Made: Added revenue impact prioritisation and specific CRM quality checks.  
Observed Effect: Produced clearer actions for improving CRM accuracy.  
Lesson Learned: Adding prioritisation improves operational decision-making.

## Prompt 10: Sales Forecasting Assistant

Version: v1.0  
Change Made: Created a prompt using basic pipeline data to estimate revenue.  
Observed Effect: Forecast was simple but lacked risk analysis and assumptions.  
Lesson Learned: Forecasting prompts require additional business variables.

Version: v2.0  
Change Made: Added sales cycle, revenue metrics, risks, and improvement recommendations.  
Observed Effect: Generated more realistic forecasting insights.  
Lesson Learned: More complete business context improves AI analysis quality.
